# KEY|what it is and what the kit uses it for|where to get it|after|when
OLLAMA_MODEL|The AI model the install downloads for Ollama (and Open WebUI's chats). The suggestion is the biggest one that fits this Mac's memory next to the rest of the server; a bigger one answers better but slower.|Any other model from ollama.com/library works too, as name:size (gemma4:12b, say). More can be added later with ollama pull <name>.||
